(7483242, 1190763, 175219, '<td valign="top">Great vanishing point. I am not usually drawn to black and white but something in this moves me to follow. Well done good luck I gave an 8.</td>', 'Great vanishing point. I am not usually drawn to black and white but something in this moves me to follow. Well done good luck I gave an 8.', '2016-11-19 20:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
