(7483532, 1190611, 50864, '<td valign="top">This is so good. That headless man is wonderful. 10</td>', 'This is so good. That headless man is wonderful. 10', '2016-11-21 18:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483534, 1190302, 50864, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Really lovely bokeh.</td>', 'Beautiful. Really lovely bokeh.', '2016-11-21 18:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483536, 1190805, 50864, '<td valign="top">Very pleasing.</td>', 'Very pleasing.', '2016-11-21 18:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483540, 1190675, 50864, '<td valign="top">Great capture.</td>', 'Great capture.', '2016-11-21 18:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483594, 1190547, 182284, '<td valign="top">To me this is a magnificent shot. Quite a piece of art. Now for the critique: Personally I love it and wish I was in an area to take a shot for myself. It meets the challenge as far as I can tell. The Sun Bow is so pretty. The only thing I could say that may have made a difference is the sun is just a tad bit too high and has blown out just a tad more than what I would like to see. This is minimal and beautiful, 10 from me. :)</td>', 'To me this is a magnificent shot. Quite a piece of art. Now for the critique: Personally I love it and wish I was in an area to take a shot for myself. It meets the challenge as far as I can tell. The Sun Bow is so pretty. The only thing I could say that may have made a difference is the sun is just a tad bit too high and has blown out just a tad more than what I would like to see. This is minimal and beautiful, 10 from me. :)', '2016-11-22 00:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483597, 1190654, 182284, '<td valign="top">If it were me taking this shot I would have walked around the edges of the water or at least walked out on the little dock before I took my shot. This meets the challenge perfectly, the color is beautiful with great contrast. The focus is good. It only lacks composition and emotion. I like to walk all around my subject and invision each angle in a box. You had a perfect opportunity to create a real piece of art with this photo even in minimal edit. I give a 7 for this.</td>', 'If it were me taking this shot I would have walked around the edges of the water or at least walked out on the little dock before I took my shot. This meets the challenge perfectly, the color is beautiful with great contrast. The focus is good. It only lacks composition and emotion. I like to walk all around my subject and invision each angle in a box. You had a perfect opportunity to create a real piece of art with this photo even in minimal edit. I give a 7 for this.', '2016-11-22 01:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483598, 1190181, 182284, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing shot and it really speaks volumes with no edit at all. This is truly a lovely shot, one worth hanging on the wall. Even with minimal edit I give it a 10</td>', 'This is an amazing shot and it really speaks volumes with no edit at all. This is truly a lovely shot, one worth hanging on the wall. Even with minimal edit I give it a 10', '2016-11-22 01:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483651, 1190821, 7889, '<td valign="top">Loving this, the 3 men and dogs are great but the person in the background hailing a taxi just completes this - 10</td>', 'Loving this, the 3 men and dogs are great but the person in the background hailing a taxi just completes this - 10', '2016-11-22 09:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483653, 1190770, 7889, '<td valign="top">Great capture ! 9 :)</td>', 'Great capture ! 9 :)', '2016-11-22 09:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483660, 1190767, 182284, '<td valign="top">What a sweet photo. Those eyes will get you everytime. Now to the critique, first thing I see is not just the bunny but a dust bunny in the lower right. I know this is minimal so I overlook that one. The bunny is just a little blurry for my liking. Overall it fits the challenge quite well and I give a 7 on a sniffing moving bunny.</td>', 'What a sweet photo. Those eyes will get you everytime. Now to the critique, first thing I see is not just the bunny but a dust bunny in the lower right. I know this is minimal so I overlook that one. The bunny is just a little blurry for my liking. Overall it fits the challenge quite well and I give a 7 on a sniffing moving bunny.', '2016-11-22 09:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483661, 1190770, 182284, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful shot for minimal, here again this one depicts emotion, beautifully composed and the desat is perfect. For this I give you a 10.</td>', 'This is a wonderful shot for minimal, here again this one depicts emotion, beautifully composed and the desat is perfect. For this I give you a 10.', '2016-11-22 09:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483664, 1190791, 182284, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot for minimal edit. You overall caught a celebration with great clarity. 7</td>', 'This is a great shot for minimal edit. You overall caught a celebration with great clarity. 7', '2016-11-22 10:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483776, 1190834, 97225, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture of the mood. My choice for blue.</td>', 'Wonderful capture of the mood. My choice for blue.', '2016-11-23 00:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483779, 1190813, 97225, '<td valign="top">Fabulous architecture, great photo.</td>', 'Fabulous architecture, great photo.', '2016-11-23 00:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483780, 1190429, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, lovely , harmonious colours. A ribbon contender.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, lovely , harmonious colours. A ribbon contender.', '2016-11-23 00:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483784, 1190839, 97225, '<td valign="top">Excellent! I love all those leading lines, including the outstretched arm and hand. A ribbon contender for sure.</td>', 'Excellent! I love all those leading lines, including the outstretched arm and hand. A ribbon contender for sure.', '2016-11-23 00:25:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483787, 1190770, 114285, '<td valign="top">This is a  really lovely shot. That kid is just about to whack those birds isn''t he? I hope not. My top pick.</td>', 'This is a  really lovely shot. That kid is just about to whack those birds isn''t he? I hope not. My top pick.', '2016-11-23 00:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483790, 1190812, 114285, '<td valign="top">I don''t normally like glass shots but to do this in a minimal is excellent!</td>', 'I don''t normally like glass shots but to do this in a minimal is excellent!', '2016-11-23 00:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483792, 1190534, 114285, '<td valign="top">so sharp, excellent shot.</td>', 'so sharp, excellent shot.', '2016-11-23 00:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483793, 1190831, 114285, '<td valign="top">Great angle.</td>', 'Great angle.', '2016-11-23 00:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483794, 1190302, 114285, '<td valign="top">Extraordinary Bokeh and light.</td>', 'Extraordinary Bokeh and light.', '2016-11-23 00:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483795, 1190834, 114285, '<td valign="top">Very sweet image</td>', 'Very sweet image', '2016-11-23 00:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483827, 1190675, 16148, '<td valign="top">A modern James Dean.  Terrific environmental portrait.</td>', 'A modern James Dean.  Terrific environmental portrait.', '2016-11-23 08:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483829, 1190770, 16148, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition and moment.  The subtle color doesn''t detract but I''d prefer b&amp;w.  Very nice!</td>', 'Lovely composition and moment.  The subtle color doesn''t detract but I''d prefer b&w.  Very nice!', '2016-11-23 08:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483842, 1190482, 180710, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen similar photos in a few different challenges.  I was impressed by the first one.  I liked the second one.  I''m ready to see something different.</td>', 'I''ve seen similar photos in a few different challenges.  I was impressed by the first one.  I liked the second one.  I''m ready to see something different.', '2016-11-23 09:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483878, 1190284, 98565, '<td valign="top">I was wondering a moment why you choose this title and then I discovered the shadow. Cool! Very cool - 8</td>', 'I was wondering a moment why you choose this title and then I discovered the shadow. Cool! Very cool - 8', '2016-11-23 16:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483879, 1190611, 98565, '<td valign="top">reminds me of Charlie Chapling walkig - the same posture... and the title is very cleverly choosen</td>', 'reminds me of Charlie Chapling walkig - the same posture... and the title is very cleverly choosen', '2016-11-23 16:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483978, 1190534, 135744, '<td valign="top">Superb detail. Great POV! You  have really captured the character of this critter</td>', 'Superb detail. Great POV! You  have really captured the character of this critter', '2016-11-24 05:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483979, 1190429, 135744, '<td valign="top">Wow great capture. I would love to capture a deer as well as this. Well done! 10 from me</td>', 'Wow great capture. I would love to capture a deer as well as this. Well done! 10 from me', '2016-11-24 05:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483985, 1190459, 100831, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bokeh and detail.</td>', 'Beautiful bokeh and detail.', '2016-11-24 08:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483986, 1190364, 100831, '<td valign="top">the light and colors are so bright and cheerful. I like the composition too, with the triangle shape behind.</td>', 'the light and colors are so bright and cheerful. I like the composition too, with the triangle shape behind.', '2016-11-24 09:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483987, 1190770, 100831, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.</td>', 'Gorgeous.', '2016-11-24 09:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483988, 1190770, 109387, '<td valign="top">It definitely tells a story. Ribbon contender</td>', 'It definitely tells a story. Ribbon contender', '2016-11-24 09:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483989, 1190482, 182284, '<td valign="top">This guy has captured my heart. This is a magnificent creature all dressed up and waiting for his rider. Everytime I see the photos of this guy it makes me smile. The only thing I might have done different is have Mr.C sit closer to the pile of rocks near the entrance. Mr.C I''m giving you a 10 because you have the sweetest smile.</td>', 'This guy has captured my heart. This is a magnificent creature all dressed up and waiting for his rider. Everytime I see the photos of this guy it makes me smile. The only thing I might have done different is have Mr.C sit closer to the pile of rocks near the entrance. Mr.C I''m giving you a 10 because you have the sweetest smile.', '2016-11-24 09:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483990, 1190364, 182284, '<td valign="top">My forte'' is flowers and I could not have done better. This is a beautiful shot showing you know your camera well and you know composition. This is one of my favorite photos because you did a perfect setup and composition. This is a beautiful minimal shot. I really think there is very little I would do in editing. Great Job! 10</td>', 'My forte'' is flowers and I could not have done better. This is a beautiful shot showing you know your camera well and you know composition. This is one of my favorite photos because you did a perfect setup and composition. This is a beautiful minimal shot. I really think there is very little I would do in editing. Great Job! 10', '2016-11-24 09:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483991, 1190813, 182284, '<td valign="top">I''m going to give it a shot and do a little critique. The building is fantablulous! I would probably want to just sit in there and take it all in. Now for the critique, the color is magnificent and as I can tell this photo meet the challenge nicely, as for the technical stuff the photo could have been rotated to make it a little more centered. This is one of those photos that does remarkably well being precisely centered. I give an 8 for this</td>', 'I''m going to give it a shot and do a little critique. The building is fantablulous! I would probably want to just sit in there and take it all in. Now for the critique, the color is magnificent and as I can tell this photo meet the challenge nicely, as for the technical stuff the photo could have been rotated to make it a little more centered. This is one of those photos that does remarkably well being precisely centered. I give an 8 for this', '2016-11-24 09:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483992, 1190520, 182284, '<td valign="top">Okay, I''m trying my hand at giving fair critiquing a go. First off my interpretation of the challenge was to take a photo with minimal edit, not minimal subject. This photo as far as I can tell meets the challenge well. Secondly I hope you''re not standing on a roof to get this shot. Thirdly the color and contrast is great. It''s nice to see green grass. Fourthly what is the white thing on the ground? You did a great job getting the sharp image by just holding the camera. 7 from me.</td>', 'Okay, I''m trying my hand at giving fair critiquing a go. First off my interpretation of the challenge was to take a photo with minimal edit, not minimal subject. This photo as far as I can tell meets the challenge well. Secondly I hope you''re not standing on a roof to get this shot. Thirdly the color and contrast is great. It''s nice to see green grass. Fourthly what is the white thing on the ground? You did a great job getting the sharp image by just holding the camera. 7 from me.', '2016-11-24 09:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483993, 1190371, 182284, '<td valign="top">At first glance I gave this a 5 but after looking at it again, I see what the Night before is. This must be party night before the big day, so I change my mind and that is always a girls prerogative, I give this one a 7. Colors are great and I think most of us have felt this way at one time or another even if it''s simply from vertigo.</td>', 'At first glance I gave this a 5 but after looking at it again, I see what the Night before is. This must be party night before the big day, so I change my mind and that is always a girls prerogative, I give this one a 7. Colors are great and I think most of us have felt this way at one time or another even if it''s simply from vertigo.', '2016-11-24 09:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483994, 1190820, 182284, '<td valign="top">Here is another photo that I''m going to give critiquing a go. It is nicely and uniformly blurred. If this is your style you have done quite well. It truly seems to match the challenge. The only thing I can honestly say is that it looks like an office waiting room and it''s not speaking to me at all and believe me I am listening but it just says "Sit down and stay awhile, then maybe you can hear me". :) 6 for you.</td>', 'Here is another photo that I''m going to give critiquing a go. It is nicely and uniformly blurred. If this is your style you have done quite well. It truly seems to match the challenge. The only thing I can honestly say is that it looks like an office waiting room and it''s not speaking to me at all and believe me I am listening but it just says "Sit down and stay awhile, then maybe you can hear me". :) 6 for you.', '2016-11-24 09:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483997, 1190793, 182284, '<td valign="top">Taking in consideration that this is minimal photography I think you should have done much better with this subject. It looks as if you just took a snapshot to show it was minimal but you could have done much better even if this is a candid shot. Minimal just means very little edit. This would have done better in B&amp;W. I''m giving this a 5.</td>', 'Taking in consideration that this is minimal photography I think you should have done much better with this subject. It looks as if you just took a snapshot to show it was minimal but you could have done much better even if this is a candid shot. Minimal just means very little edit. This would have done better in B&W. I''m giving this a 5.', '2016-11-24 10:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7483998, 1190401, 182284, '<td valign="top">I love the lion fish. This meets the challenge well. I know you could do a much better job if the little lion would hold still but I''m sure he just keeps moving. The colors are just a bit muted for my taste but being reminded this is minimal overall you did quite well catching the little bugger as well as you did. I give this one a 6.</td>', 'I love the lion fish. This meets the challenge well. I know you could do a much better job if the little lion would hold still but I''m sure he just keeps moving. The colors are just a bit muted for my taste but being reminded this is minimal overall you did quite well catching the little bugger as well as you did. I give this one a 6.', '2016-11-24 10:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484011, 1190675, 140305, '<td valign="top">(Have to say I thought of Prince for a moment when I first saw this).  Love the concentration on his face, light &amp; shadow, coffee &amp; cigarette, and of course he couldn''t have been holding that cup in a better position. An engaging photo. Great candid!</td>', '(Have to say I thought of Prince for a moment when I first saw this).  Love the concentration on his face, light & shadow, coffee & cigarette, and of course he couldn''t have been holding that cup in a better position. An engaging photo. Great candid!', '2016-11-24 11:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484013, 1190805, 140305, '<td valign="top">This is what becomes of us as we sit in those little rooms waiting for the doctor to appear :)</td>', 'This is what becomes of us as we sit in those little rooms waiting for the doctor to appear :)', '2016-11-24 11:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484014, 1190813, 140305, '<td valign="top">I hope you have added the location in your notes :)</td>', 'I hope you have added the location in your notes :)', '2016-11-24 11:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484015, 1190534, 140305, '<td valign="top">We were bombarded with these guys in the summer of 2015 so I was busy taking lots of pictures too. They are quite patient little things (or maybe they''re just still because they''re playing dead?) with a most interesting array of colours and markings. I''m very glad they aren''t any larger, they have decidedly nasty looking chompers. Anyways, great composition, colours and focus!</td>', 'We were bombarded with these guys in the summer of 2015 so I was busy taking lots of pictures too. They are quite patient little things (or maybe they''re just still because they''re playing dead?) with a most interesting array of colours and markings. I''m very glad they aren''t any larger, they have decidedly nasty looking chompers. Anyways, great composition, colours and focus!', '2016-11-24 11:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484016, 1190824, 140305, '<td valign="top">looks as though someone lost their fish hook or float? Nice autumnal photo.</td>', 'looks as though someone lost their fish hook or float? Nice autumnal photo.', '2016-11-24 11:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484018, 1190804, 140305, '<td valign="top">For minimal editing, pretty great stuff, I''d say. IMHO this belongs on the front page :)</td>', 'For minimal editing, pretty great stuff, I''d say. IMHO this belongs on the front page :)', '2016-11-24 11:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484020, 1190302, 140305, '<td valign="top">bokeh is pretty spectacular! Colour combination and light is beautiful, this should finish high.</td>', 'bokeh is pretty spectacular! Colour combination and light is beautiful, this should finish high.', '2016-11-24 11:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484021, 1190770, 140305, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Makes me wonder if those birds flew off in a few seconds, would love to see that (but not at the expense of the motion of the girl running, her pose is perfect). Great photo!</td>', 'Beautiful! Makes me wonder if those birds flew off in a few seconds, would love to see that (but not at the expense of the motion of the girl running, her pose is perfect). Great photo!', '2016-11-24 11:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484023, 1190480, 140305, '<td valign="top">Wow, perfect timing or what? Love these kinds of shots with the unexpected results :)</td>', 'Wow, perfect timing or what? Love these kinds of shots with the unexpected results :)', '2016-11-24 12:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484032, 1190606, 24744, '<td valign="top">for architectural shots with prominent verticals, it really helps to have the camera straight - the tower on the right leans to the left.  There are also noticeable sharpening halos around the entire building against the sky.</td>', 'for architectural shots with prominent verticals, it really helps to have the camera straight - the tower on the right leans to the left.  There are also noticeable sharpening halos around the entire building against the sky.', '2016-11-24 12:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484033, 1190241, 24744, '<td valign="top">There seems to be just a bit of a warm colour cast that could have been avoided with a custom white balance setting in camera.</td>', 'There seems to be just a bit of a warm colour cast that could have been avoided with a custom white balance setting in camera.', '2016-11-24 12:37:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484034, 1190789, 24744, '<td valign="top">The off-vertical tilt of the window frames along the right edge of the image detract from the shot somewhat.</td>', 'The off-vertical tilt of the window frames along the right edge of the image detract from the shot somewhat.', '2016-11-24 12:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484035, 1190831, 24744, '<td valign="top">A lot of the highlights on the structure are blown out, losing a lot of detail.</td>', 'A lot of the highlights on the structure are blown out, losing a lot of detail.', '2016-11-24 12:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484036, 1190429, 24744, '<td valign="top">A shallower depth of field would have helped to isolate the subject from the background more, as would tighter framing.</td>', 'A shallower depth of field would have helped to isolate the subject from the background more, as would tighter framing.', '2016-11-24 12:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484037, 1190765, 24744, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred to see the whole mushroom in sharp focus, rather than the leaf litter in the background - the entire focal plane seems to be somewhat behind it.</td>', 'I would have preferred to see the whole mushroom in sharp focus, rather than the leaf litter in the background - the entire focal plane seems to be somewhat behind it.', '2016-11-24 12:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484038, 1190805, 24744, '<td valign="top">The verticals are just a little off-vertical, which detracts from the composition.</td>', 'The verticals are just a little off-vertical, which detracts from the composition.', '2016-11-24 12:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484039, 1190812, 24744, '<td valign="top">It''s very hard to do a shot like this without being left with any reflections or much dust to clone out - nicely done.</td>', 'It''s very hard to do a shot like this without being left with any reflections or much dust to clone out - nicely done.', '2016-11-24 12:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484040, 1190797, 24744, '<td valign="top">You seem to have missed focus on the egret entirely, in favour of the distracting background.  The grass behind is also showing sharpening halos.</td>', 'You seem to have missed focus on the egret entirely, in favour of the distracting background.  The grass behind is also showing sharpening halos.', '2016-11-24 12:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484042, 1190839, 24744, '<td valign="top">Pleasant smooth tones - difficult to do with a flat desat.  Was a blue filter setting used in-camera?</td>', 'Pleasant smooth tones - difficult to do with a flat desat.  Was a blue filter setting used in-camera?', '2016-11-24 12:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484043, 1190804, 24744, '<td valign="top">Excellently executed shot; there''s nothing I would improve about this.  The tones, timing  and exposure are perfect, and the composition is strong.</td>', 'Excellently executed shot; there''s nothing I would improve about this.  The tones, timing  and exposure are perfect, and the composition is strong.', '2016-11-24 12:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484045, 1190409, 24744, '<td valign="top">Overall just a little more depth of field could have helped to pick out the fine hairs and other details that are mostly lost here except on the grasshopper''s nearest leg; the strongly out of focus foreground flowers are also a little distracting and lead the eye away from the main subject.</td>', 'Overall just a little more depth of field could have helped to pick out the fine hairs and other details that are mostly lost here except on the grasshopper''s nearest leg; the strongly out of focus foreground flowers are also a little distracting and lead the eye away from the main subject.', '2016-11-24 12:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484046, 1190459, 24744, '<td valign="top">Good tones and colours, as well as depth of field and background interaction.  I would have framed a little differently to get the eye closer to a golden mean point, or perhaps gone in a little closer still.</td>', 'Good tones and colours, as well as depth of field and background interaction.  I would have framed a little differently to get the eye closer to a golden mean point, or perhaps gone in a little closer still.', '2016-11-24 12:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484047, 1190816, 24744, '<td valign="top">Holding the camera level would have improved this shot considerably.</td>', 'Holding the camera level would have improved this shot considerably.', '2016-11-24 12:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484048, 1190792, 24744, '<td valign="top">Strong composition, although the sign in the lower right somewhat distracts from it - moving in a little closer to get rid of it would improve this.</td>', 'Strong composition, although the sign in the lower right somewhat distracts from it - moving in a little closer to get rid of it would improve this.', '2016-11-24 12:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484049, 1190799, 24744, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting display of the fisheye lens, but some actual compositional elements would have made this a more interesting image; as it is, the eye is just drawn to the two upper corners in search of something less homogenous, and in those corners we just find distracting elements there that could have been omitted.</td>', 'It''s an interesting display of the fisheye lens, but some actual compositional elements would have made this a more interesting image; as it is, the eye is just drawn to the two upper corners in search of something less homogenous, and in those corners we just find distracting elements there that could have been omitted.', '2016-11-24 12:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484051, 1190534, 24744, '<td valign="top">Overall very strong shot with good colours.  The background noise is a little distracting, however, and it seems to have been amplified by excessive sharpening - there is also a sharpening halo around the edge of the eye on the left.</td>', 'Overall very strong shot with good colours.  The background noise is a little distracting, however, and it seems to have been amplified by excessive sharpening - there is also a sharpening halo around the edge of the eye on the left.', '2016-11-24 12:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484053, 1190770, 24744, '<td valign="top">Good tones and composition, but the sepia conversion (presumably in-camera?) has left some splotchy artefacts in the hills and seems to have lost detail around the water.  You also have some undesirabe sharpening halos, especially noticeable around the outline of the stick.</td>', 'Good tones and composition, but the sepia conversion (presumably in-camera?) has left some splotchy artefacts in the hills and seems to have lost detail around the water.  You also have some undesirabe sharpening halos, especially noticeable around the outline of the stick.', '2016-11-24 13:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484054, 1190181, 24744, '<td valign="top">Good tones, composition, colour and concept.</td>', 'Good tones, composition, colour and concept.', '2016-11-24 13:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484055, 1190813, 24744, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of the fisheye with this subject matter; the central elements are just a bit off centre to the right, however, which detracts from the strongly symmetrical composition.  The blown out bright spots of the lights, especially on the left side, also take away a little from an otherwise strong image.</td>', 'Interesting use of the fisheye with this subject matter; the central elements are just a bit off centre to the right, however, which detracts from the strongly symmetrical composition.  The blown out bright spots of the lights, especially on the left side, also take away a little from an otherwise strong image.', '2016-11-24 13:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484057, 1190401, 24744, '<td valign="top">Nice concept but too soft to score well, with what looks like motion blur as well as overall being out of focus, and coloured fringing - presumably from refraction on the aquarium glass.</td>', 'Nice concept but too soft to score well, with what looks like motion blur as well as overall being out of focus, and coloured fringing - presumably from refraction on the aquarium glass.', '2016-11-24 13:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484058, 1190794, 24744, '<td valign="top">They''re very characterful birds to shoot.  Unofrunately, the dull lighting, distracting reflection in the eye, excessively wide composition, and horribly distracting bokeh demonstrating the cage bars of this captive bird, all conspire to waste any potential this shot may have had.</td>', 'They''re very characterful birds to shoot.  Unofrunately, the dull lighting, distracting reflection in the eye, excessively wide composition, and horribly distracting bokeh demonstrating the cage bars of this captive bird, all conspire to waste any potential this shot may have had.', '2016-11-24 13:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484059, 1190520, 24744, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract composition.  I find the vignette takes away from the interplay of strong flat colours a little - it would have been a more dramatic image with an even tone all along the lit part of the grass.</td>', 'Interesting abstract composition.  I find the vignette takes away from the interplay of strong flat colours a little - it would have been a more dramatic image with an even tone all along the lit part of the grass.', '2016-11-24 13:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484060, 1190145, 24744, '<td valign="top">The building touching the edge of the frame breaks up and distracts from an otherwise very strong composition.</td>', 'The building touching the edge of the frame breaks up and distracts from an otherwise very strong composition.', '2016-11-24 13:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484061, 1190654, 24744, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, but the composition is rather awkward, with the eye being led to the pole just off centre, rather than the house and bridge as seems to be intended, and the goose at the left edge leading the eye out of the frame.</td>', 'Nice colours, but the composition is rather awkward, with the eye being led to the pole just off centre, rather than the house and bridge as seems to be intended, and the goose at the left edge leading the eye out of the frame.', '2016-11-24 13:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484062, 1190547, 24744, '<td valign="top">Strong composition and excellent tones; the flare from the sun here helps fill the shadows perfectly.  Unfortunately there''s a small distracting flare hot spot in the lower left which of course can''t be cleaned up in minimal editing.  There''s also a bit of a sharpening halo along the top edges of the islands in the background.</td>', 'Strong composition and excellent tones; the flare from the sun here helps fill the shadows perfectly.  Unfortunately there''s a small distracting flare hot spot in the lower left which of course can''t be cleaned up in minimal editing.  There''s also a bit of a sharpening halo along the top edges of the islands in the background.', '2016-11-24 13:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484063, 1190476, 24744, '<td valign="top">Good tones and composition; shame about the scaffolding on the nearest corner.  The entire image does seem to have a very slight overall lean to the left - tilting the camera a degree or so more counterclockwise could have helped.</td>', 'Good tones and composition; shame about the scaffolding on the nearest corner.  The entire image does seem to have a very slight overall lean to the left - tilting the camera a degree or so more counterclockwise could have helped.', '2016-11-24 13:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484064, 1190691, 24744, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, although the jar on the right leads the eye out of the frame a little too much.  The steam is an excellent feature.  Overall, however, the lighting is a bit too harsh - the harsh specular highlights on the peppers and the glass, and the chaotic reflections, all detract from the image.  Lighting with a softbox or an umbrella could have improved this a lot.</td>', 'Nice composition, although the jar on the right leads the eye out of the frame a little too much.  The steam is an excellent feature.  Overall, however, the lighting is a bit too harsh - the harsh specular highlights on the peppers and the glass, and the chaotic reflections, all detract from the image.  Lighting with a softbox or an umbrella could have improved this a lot.', '2016-11-24 13:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484066, 1190675, 24744, '<td valign="top">Good composition and tones; if the highlights on the hair and jacket weren''t blown, out it would be even better.</td>', 'Good composition and tones; if the highlights on the hair and jacket weren''t blown, out it would be even better.', '2016-11-24 13:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484067, 1190302, 24744, '<td valign="top">Interesting bokeh, contrasting tones and composition.</td>', 'Interesting bokeh, contrasting tones and composition.', '2016-11-24 13:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484069, 1190836, 24744, '<td valign="top">If you held the camera straight, this shot would have scored much better.<br/> <br/>By the way, it''s 3:49, not 3:59.</td>', 'If you held the camera straight, this shot would have scored much better. By the way, it''s 3:49, not 3:59.', '2016-11-24 13:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
