(7484119, 1190459, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love this DOF... and the composition.<br/> <br/>I wish you''d sharpened it so the eye is totally in focus... but it''s off a bit... the belly feathers are more in focus than the eye.<br/> <br/>Still... a WONDERFUL image!!</td>', 'I love this DOF... and the composition. I wish you''d sharpened it so the eye is totally in focus... but it''s off a bit... the belly feathers are more in focus than the eye. Still... a WONDERFUL image!!', '2016-11-24 22:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(7484120, 1190770, 86447, '<td valign="top">I love the leading line of the stick through her body and on to the birds!  Might have worked even better if you''d flipped this horizontally so the eye flows more easily Left to Right as we are inclined to view images... and their lines.<br/> <br/>Great choice to do this in BW.<br/> <br/>I really enjoy this image.</td>', 'I love the leading line of the stick through her body and on to the birds!  Might have worked even better if you''d flipped this horizontally so the eye flows more easily Left to Right as we are inclined to view images... and their lines. Great choice to do this in BW. I really enjoy this image.', '2016-11-24 22:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
